# Its two free-text labels both match some inputs (the shortest lint finds is
# "send $ 0 to 결제 환불해줘"); the lint comment allows that, so
# `nlu_script_cli --lint` reports no findings.
# lint: allow-overlap transfer:send payment:refund

card:lost
    <card>[신용{type=CREDIT}|체크{type=DEBIT}]카드</card>(을/를) 분실했어요
    I lost my <card>[credit{type=CREDIT}|debit{type=DEBIT}] card</card>

transfer:send
    send `@{MONEY} to <recipient><?>+?</recipient>

payment:refund
    <merchant><?>+?</merchant> 결제 환불::[해줘|해주세요]
